es?</div> </div> </div> </div>Like a creepy Japanese girl ghost.<br /> <br /> Yuk yuk yuk.<br /> <br /> (I haven't seen the movie, so I can't actually help.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-17T01:58:08-07:00","id":1235836,"title":"","content":"<u><b>The Beast</b></u><br /> Type: Barghest<br /> Rank: 3<br /> Power: 9<br /> Finesse: 3<br /> Resistance: 7<br /> Numina: 4<br /> Anchor: Crossroads where the rabid dog was burned, tree that grew on its ashes<br /> Ban: Church bells - must dematerialize when hearing them<br /> Bane: powdered pearl<br /> Influence: Anchor 2, Canines 3, Fire 2<br /> Manifestations: Twilight Form, Materialize, Possess, Fetter, Claim<br /> Numina: Awe, Firestarter, Regenerate, Speed, Seek<br /> <br /> This is basically an attempt to recreate and adapt the final boss of The Witcher 1's chapter 1, a Barghest called the Beast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-17T02:10:00-07:00","id":1235841,"title":"","